"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1JVC6T3VR1S0AJ5P\",\"title\":\"INTERCARBO — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"UNDER VALIDATION\",\"BICRS\",\"INTERCARBO\",\"Interholco\",\"->\",\"PROJECT DETAILS\",\"Expected first certificates\",\"2027\",\"Project code\",\"3VAJ\",\"Crediting period\",\"02 Jan 2026 to 02 Jan 2031\"],\"issued_header\":null,\"buffer_header\":null,\"crediting\":null,\"verifier\":null,\"code\":\"3VAJ\",\"approval\":\"Expected 2027\",\"protocol_current\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.2\",\"protocol_baseline\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.1\",\"cert_issued\":null,\"cert_retired\":null,\"cert_buffer\":null,\"reversal\":null,\"showing\":[\"Showing 2 of 2\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"11 Aug 2025\",\"Public Comment Summary\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"10 Jul 2025\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"https://interholco.com\",\"t\":\"Interholco\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/biochar/1.2\",\"t\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.2\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/biochar/1.1\",\"t\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.1\"},{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1JSEKMWXZ1S0R19Z\",\"t\":\"Learn more\"},{\"h\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/standard#validation-and-verification-requirements\",\"t\":\"Isometric Standard\"},{\"h\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KOmLuhU6yzCYYtUWPyQCw4aByEEJ7Q1-/view\",\"t\":\"VVB Policy\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JSEKMWXZ1S0R19Z/prj_1JVC6T3VR1S0AJ5P/pjd_1K2JA2K3N1S0PVJT/public_comment_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JSEKMWXZ1S0R19Z/prj_1JVC6T3VR1S0AJ5P/pjd_1K050634W1S0ECBB/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"UNDER VALIDATION\\nBICRS\\nINTERCARBO\\nInterholco\\n->\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nExpected first certificates\\n2027\\nProject code\\n3VAJ\\nCrediting period\\n02 Jan 2026 to 02 Jan 2031\\nPROTOCOL DETAILS\\nCurrent protocol version\\nBiochar Production and Storage v1.2\\nBaseline protocol version\\nBiochar Production and Storage v1.1\\nSummary\\n\\nINTERCARBO, Interholco’s biochar production facility in northern Republic of Congo, transforms sawmill waste into biochar through an advanced pyrolysis process. This sustainable initiative prevents open-air burning, reducing emissions and improving air quality. The produced biochar serves as a long-term carbon sink in Interholco’s own forest concession, and is buried under abandoned forest roads. By turning wood waste into a valuable resource, InterCarbo contributes to climate change mitigation and ecological restoration.\\n\\nRepublic of Congo\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nBiomass Carbon Removal and Storage (BiCRS) involves storing the carbon contained in waste biomass—organic material from living or recently living organisms. BiCRS works by halting or slowing the decomposition of biomass, enabling the carbon it contains to be stored long-term. This can be achieved by converting biomass into materials that decompose more slowly—such as biochar or bio-oil—or by storing it in environments where decomposition is slowed. For BiCRS to count as carbon removal, the biomass must be replenished to ensure additional carbon dioxide is drawn from the atmosphere.\\n\\nLearn more\\nProject timeline\\nCompleted 08 Aug 2025\\nPublic comment period\\nCompleted 2025\\nInitial documentation submission\\nExpected 2027\\nIN PROGRESS\\nAudit kick-off\\n\\nA Validation & Verification Body (VVB) officially commences the project validation and verification process. All VVBs are approved and appointed by Isometric based on the requirements outlined in the Isometric Standard and VVB Policy.\\n\\nExpected 2027\\nSite visit\\nExpected 2027\\nApproval date\\nExpected 2027\\nInitial credit issuance\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n11 Aug 2025\\tPublic Comment Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n10 Jul 2025\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 2 of 2\\nPrevious\\nNext\"}"